{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1502","id":4019163493,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87vj5Fl","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1502","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1502.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1502.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1502","number":1502,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: run all-3530 MS page locator backfill and produce blocker map (#1489)","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1489.\n\n## What\n\nRuns the merged #1488 deterministic MS page-locator backfill harness across all **3530** governed 9709 rows and materialises the **runtime locator inventory v2**, a **blocker map**, and a **readback**.\n\n`scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-page-locator-backfill-all-3530.mjs` re-runs the #1488 harness in-process (aborts unless its validator passes), then re-shapes each row into a multi-page-aware inventory. It never guesses: uncertain multi-page evidence is preserved as `needs_manual_review`, and ambiguity (multiple candidate pages/documents) is preserved rather than collapsed.\n\n## Results (launch gate BLOCKED)\n\n| metric | value |\n| --- | ---: |\n| total governed rows | 3530 |\n| duplicate_question_key_count | 0 |\n| exact_located | 28 |\n| page_located | 607 |\n| **page_or_exact_located_count_after_backfill** | **635** |\n| **document_only_count_after_backfill** | **1563** |\n| ambiguous | 1058 |\n| needs_manual_review | 274 |\n| **missing_ms_row_count** | **0** |\n| **document_only_student_reveal_allowed_count** | **0** |\n| cross_page_row_count | 32 |\n| located_row_count / located_page_count | 635 / 693 |\n| same_page exposure / warning-missing | 490 / 0 |\n\npage/exact coverage **17.99% < 95%** → `launch_readiness_locator_gate=blocked` with exact blocker reasons and per-row/page/document IDs in the blocker map (2895 blocked rows, 399 prioritized papers).\n\n## Multi-page amendment\n\n- `ms_page_range` (`start`/`end`/`page_count`/`is_cross_page`/`cross_page_reason`) and `located_pages` with roles `target_start` / `target_continuation` / `neighbor_context`.\n- Single-page rows whose continuation can't be deterministically bounded → `needs_manual_review` (not truncated). Boundaries are confirmed only via next-question start page, a later question sharing the page, or the last document page.\n\n## Safety\n\nNo screenshots, OCR/VLM, external model calls, or production Supabase / RAG / vector mutations (`side_effect_receipt` all zero). document_only rows stay non-student-display by default.\n\n## Artifacts\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-page-locator-backfill-all-3530.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-page-locator-backfill-all-3530.validator-result.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-page-locator-backfill-blocker-map.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-page-locator-backfill.readback.md`\n\n## Tests\n\n`scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-page-locator-backfill-all-3530.test.js` — taxonomy/shape, cross-page, needs_manual_review, gate blocked/ready, validator pass, side-effect zeros, plus a real-input end-to-end run. Output is deterministic across runs. #1488 suite still green.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","created_at":"2026-07-09T03:52:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T03:58:05Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T03:58:05Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T03:58:05Z","merge_commit_sha":"6dc73305cde0ea017777e8fcb79fb114bd93a765","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1502/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1502/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1502/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/16cd89fa608a9d396b8015bdd4f68286ec30f2ce","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1489","ref":"feat/issue-1489","sha":"16cd89fa608a9d396b8015bdd4f68286ec30f2ce","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","e